      "type": "text",
      "x": 731.14,
      "y": 2055.0,
      "width": 342.72,
      "height": 120.0,
      "text": "THE METRIC WAS UNMEASURABLE AT FIRST\nfalse approves / APPROVALS. at 22 approvals one\nerror scores 4.5% - so 1% could never be observed.\n\n   same code, 50 cases   ->  33.3% false-approve\n   same code, 312 cases  ->   3.9% false-approve\n\n8x drop, zero code change. it was all quantisation.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el1103",
      "originalText": "THE METRIC WAS UNMEASURABLE AT FIRST\nfalse approves / APPROVALS. at 22 approvals one\nerror scores 4.5% - so 1% could never be observed.\n\n   same code, 50 cases   ->  33.3% false-approve\n   same code, 312 cases  ->   3.9% false-approve\n\n8x drop, zero code change. it was all quantisation.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
